, "files": [{"appdesc": "附件.docx", "appdocid": 1819334, "appfile": "P020220818640534595592.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/zwzx/gsgg/202208/t20220818_1819334.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202208/P020220818/P020220818640534595592.docx", "_href": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/zwzx/gsgg/202208/P020220818640534595592.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/zwzx/gsgg/202208/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1775461, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "奖励表彰", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/zxwj/202204/t20220408_1775461.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）人力资源和社会保障局，市直各有关单位：\n　　根据《福建省人力资源和社会保障厅关于公布2022年市、县级党委和政府表彰奖励项目的通知》（闽人社表彰〔2022〕6号）精神，现将全市2022年市、县党委", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/zxwj/202204/t20220408_1775461.htm", "docreltime": "2022.04.08 17:13:00", "doctitle": "关于公布2022年市县级党委和政府表彰奖励项目的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明人社〔2022〕102号", "idxid": "SM00113-40-2022-00049", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2022.04.02 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "recid": 1911488, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/zxwj/202204/t20220408_1775461.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件.docx", "appdocid": 1775461, "appfile": "P020220408621281880914.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/zxwj/202204/t20220408_1775461.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202204/P020220408/P020220408621281880914.docx", "_href": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/zxwj/202204/P020220408621281880914.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/zxwj/202204/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1760040, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "奖励表彰", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/gsgg/qt_5599/202202/t20220224_1760040.htm", "content": "\n　　为树立榜样、弘扬先进，推动国土绿化高质量发展，根据省委办公厅、省政府办公厅《关于做好全省造林绿化工作先进集体和先进个人推荐评选工作的通知》（闽委办发明电〔2022〕9号），将对2017年以来在全省造林绿化", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/gsgg/qt_5599/202202/t20220224_1760040.htm", "docreltime": "2022.02.24 17:16:00", "doctitle": "关于全省造林绿化工作先进集体和先进工作者推荐对象的公示", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1880441, "sourcename": "市林业局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/gsgg/qt_5599/202202/t20220224_1760040.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "全省造林绿化先进集体和个人推荐名单公示.doc", "appdocid": 1760040, "appfile": "P020220224623125125498.doc", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/gsgg/qt_5599/202202/t20220224_1760040.htm", "fileext": "doc", "_src": "/protect/P0202202/P020220224/P020220224623125125498.doc", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/gsgg/qt_5599/202202/P020220224623125125498.doc"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/gsgg/qt_5599/202202/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1754047, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "奖励表彰", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/gsgg/qt_5599/202201/t20220127_1754047.htm", "content": "\n　　为肯定成绩、表扬先进，激励全市各级各单位继续扎实做好“三抓一促”，深化“五比五晒”，全方位推动三明高质量发展，市委、市政府决定对在2021年度“五比五晒”推进高质量发展活动中表现先进的集体给予表彰。 ", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/gsgg/qt_5599/202201/t20220127_1754047.htm", "docreltime": "2022.01.27 20:53:00", "doctitle": "关于2021年度“五比五晒”推进高质量发展活动拟表彰集体的公示公告", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1874442, "sourcename": "三明市发改委网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/gsgg/qt_5599/202201/t20220127_1754047.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/gsgg/qt_5599/202201/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1751381, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "奖励表彰", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202201/t20220119_1751381.htm", "content": "\n　　为激励干部干事创业，推动市区“依法和谐征迁”工作再上新台阶，市委、市政府决定对在2021年市区“依法和谐征迁”百日攻坚行动中成绩突出的个人进行及时奖励。\n　　为充分发扬民主，接受社会监督，根据《公务员", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202201/t20220119_1751381.htm", "docreltime": "2022.01.19 17:43:00", "doctitle": "关于2021年市区“依法和谐征迁”百日攻坚行动拟奖励对象公示公告", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1870645, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202201/t20220119_1751381.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件.docx", "appdocid": 1751381, "appfile": "P020220119639225946813.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202201/t20220119_1751381.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202201/P020220119/P020220119639225946813.docx", "_href": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202201/P020220119639225946813.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202201/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1750642, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "奖励表彰", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202201/t20220118_1750642.htm", "content": "\n　　在全国第十一届残运会上，我市16名残疾人运动员斩获7金4银4铜，打破全国纪录4项，金牌总数位列全省第二，为表彰三明市残联在残疾人体育事业方面作出的突出贡献，经有关部门审核同意，拟提请市委、市政府给予市残", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202201/t20220118_1750642.htm", "docreltime": "2022.01.18 10:14:00", "doctitle": "关于拟对三明市残疾人联合会记集体三等功的公示", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1870644, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202201/t20220118_1750642.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202201/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1737818, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "奖励表彰", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/hjbhggwsaqscspypcpzldjdjcqk/202112/t20211215_1737818.htm", "content": "\n\n\n 各县（市、区）人民政府，市直各单位：\n近年来，我市广大环卫工人充分发扬“宁愿一人脏，换来万家洁”的环卫精神，在艰苦的岗位上团结拼搏、无私奉献，用朴实的劳动和辛勤的汗水履行着城市美容师光荣而神圣的", "docabstract": "最佳城市美容师", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/hjbhggwsaqscspypcpzldjdjcqk/202112/t20211215_1737818.htm", "docreltime": "2021.12.15 17:04:00", "doctitle": "三明市人民政府关于表扬三明市首届“最佳城市美容师”的通报", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明政文〔2021〕148号", "idxid": "SM00101-1200-2021-00298", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2021.12.10 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市人民政府", "recid": 1867562, "sourcename": "市政府办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/hjbhggwsaqscspypcpzldjdjcqk/202112/t20211215_1737818.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "[原件]明政文〔2021〕148号（关于表扬三明市首届“最佳城市美容师”的通报）.ofd", "appdocid": 1737818, "appfile": "P020211215616313215387.ofd", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/hjbhggwsaqscspypcpzldjdjcqk/202112/t20211215_1737818.htm", "fileext": "ofd", "_src": "/protect/P0202112/P020211215/P020211215616313215387.ofd", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/hjbhggwsaqscspypcpzldjdjcqk/202112/P020211215616313215387.ofd"}], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/hjbhggwsaqscspypcpzldjdjcqk/202112/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1724104, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "奖励表彰", "chnldocurl": "http://smsfj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202111/t20211104_1724104.htm", "content": "\n　　根据中共三明市委宣传部、三明市司法局《关于2016-2020年全市普法工作先进单位、先进个人和依法治理创建活动先进单位评选表彰推荐工作的通知》（明司〔2021〕6号）要求，现就三明市拟表彰的2016-2020年全市普法", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smsfj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202111/t20211104_1724104.htm", "docreltime": "2021.11.04 18:31:00", "doctitle": "2016-2020年全市普法工作先进单位、先进个人和依法治理创建活动先进单位拟表彰名单公示", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1867574, "sourcename": "三明市司法局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smsfj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202111/t20211104_1724104.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smsfj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202111/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1715636, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "奖励表彰", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202110/t20211016_1715636.htm", "content": "\n　　为激励各级各有关单位干部职工以更加昂扬的精神、饱满的热情投入到三明全国林业改革发展综合试点市建设当中，推进林改再出发，市委、市政府决定对在深化林改工作中表现突出的集体和个人给予及时奖励。\n　　为充", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202110/t20211016_1715636.htm", "docreltime": "2021.10.16 09:25:00", "doctitle": "关于深化林改工作拟表扬和奖励对象公示公告", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1831506, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202110/t20211016_1715636.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件.docx", "appdocid": 1715636, "appfile": "P020211016339894411398.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202110/t20211016_1715636.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202110/P020211016/P020211016339894411398.docx", "_href": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202110/P020211016339894411398.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202110/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1713876, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "奖励表彰", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202110/t20211011_1713876.htm", "content": "\n　　为激励各级各有关部门和广大医务工作者以更加高昂的精气神投入到医改工作当中，进一步推动“三明医改”向纵深发展，市委、市政府决定对在“十三五”期间医改工作成绩突出的集体和个人进行及时奖励。\n　　为充分", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202110/t20211011_1713876.htm", "docreltime": "2021.10.11 16:54:00", "doctitle": "关于“十三五”期间医改工作拟奖励对象公示公告", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1824203, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202110/t20211011_1713876.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件1.doc", "appdocid": 1713876, "appfile": "P020211011610859262410.doc", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202110/t20211011_1713876.htm", "fileext": "doc", "_src": "/protect/P0202110/P020211011/P020211011610859262410.doc", "_href": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202110/P020211011610859262410.doc"}], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202110/", "rels": []}]}